graph TB
    subgraph "1. Subscription Key Authentication"
        Client1[Client] -->|Request + Subscription Key| APIM1[APIM Gateway]
        APIM1 -->|Validate Key| Sub1{Key Valid?}
        Sub1 -->|Yes| Backend1[Backend API]
        Sub1 -->|No| Reject1[401 Unauthorized]
    end

    subgraph "2. OAuth 2.0 / JWT Authentication"
        Client2[Client] -->|1. Request Token| AAD[Azure AD / OAuth Provider]
        AAD -->|2. Return JWT Token| Client2
        Client2 -->|3. Request + Bearer Token| APIM2[APIM Gateway]
        APIM2 -->|4. Validate JWT| JWT{Token Valid?}
        JWT -->|Yes| Backend2[Backend API]
        JWT -->|No| Reject2[401 Unauthorized]
    end

    subgraph "3. Client Certificate Authentication"
        Client3[Client] -->|Request + Client Cert| APIM3[APIM Gateway]
        APIM3 -->|Validate Certificate| Cert{Cert Valid?}
        Cert -->|Yes| Backend3[Backend API]
        Cert -->|No| Reject3[401 Unauthorized]
    end

    subgraph "4. Managed Identity to Backend"
        Client4[Client] -->|Request + Subscription Key| APIM4[APIM Gateway]
        APIM4 -->|Use Managed Identity| MI[Managed Identity]
        MI -->|Get Token| AAD2[Azure AD]
        AAD2 -->|Return Token| MI
        APIM4 -->|Request + Token| Backend4[Backend API]
    end

    subgraph "5. API Key Header/Query Parameter"
        Client5[Client] -->|Request + API Key| APIM5[APIM Gateway]
        APIM5 -->|Check Named Value| Key{Key Valid?}
        Key -->|Yes| Backend5[Backend API]
        Key -->|No| Reject5[401 Unauthorized]
    end

    style APIM1 fill:#0078d4,stroke:#005a9e,color:#fff
    style APIM2 fill:#0078d4,stroke:#005a9e,color:#fff
    style APIM3 fill:#0078d4,stroke:#005a9e,color:#fff
    style APIM4 fill:#0078d4,stroke:#005a9e,color:#fff
    style APIM5 fill:#0078d4,stroke:#005a9e,color:#fff
    style AAD fill:#00bcf2,color:#000
    style AAD2 fill:#00bcf2,color:#000
